  "body": "Salvage of the unique remainder of closed archive PR #7370 (task 14084, issue #7297).\n\n## What this is\nPR #7370's tip (b3568e9d47, a janitor archive of dirty worktree 10653) carries a coherent change absent from current main, verified by blob/added-line comparison (task 13628 analysis + fresh re-check 2026-11-09, lane code-y): main has not touched these files since the PR's merge-base, and no other code reads the removed `password-hash` / `password-hash-type` session-permission extensions.\n\n## Change\n- `pkgs/identity/cmd/ssh/ssh.go`: auth log calls no longer include plaintext passwords, password hashes, keyboard-interactive responses, generated private keys, or melted private keys; the dead writes of the password hash into session permission extensions are removed.\n- `pkgs/identity/web/web.go`: token/cookie log calls no longer include raw tokens, cookies, or parsed claims (algorithm / cookie name only); dead token-marshalling error path removed.\n- New AST regression tests `pkgs/identity/cmd/ssh/ssh_logging_test.go` and `pkgs/identity/web/auth_logging_test.go` fail if credential material is referenced from auth log calls again.\n\n## Tests\n- `go test -count=1 ./cmd/ssh/ ./web/` in pkgs/identity — pass (laptop, 2026-11-09)\n- `go vet ./cmd/ssh/ ./web/` — clean\n\nCherry-pick of b3568e9d47 onto current main (494198a687 before message amend); closed PR #7370 is not reopened and its archive branch is not recreated.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796791973&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=7955&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F7955&signature=48df2eb98aee80ab03bb972b5c10b6e971570dbe200112f1d84f62461500a639\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/7955?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->",
